      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 289.16,
      "end_seconds": 313.24,
      "duration_seconds": 24.08,
      "text": "right, right. Cut back on tea, coffee and fizzy drinks for a couple of weeks and see how things settle. Keep an eye out, and if the symptoms get worse, call us the same day or go to emergency. We'll catch up in two weeks. Is there anything you'd like me to go over again?"
